  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.15.0-alpha.1 - 2026-06-11\n\n### Features\n\n- Add an npm install option for the UniClipboard CLI on supported macOS, Linux, and Windows platforms (#1028)\n- Add signed checksums for release downloads so users can verify installers before running them (#1019)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix Windows background-service crashes that could interrupt sync or transfers (#1006)\n- Make the release notes scrollbar lighter and consistent with the rest of the app (#1027)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.15.0-alpha.1 - 2026-06-11\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增通过 npm 安装 UniClipboard CLI 的方式，支持 macOS、Linux 和 Windows 的已支持平台 (#1028)\n- 发布下载现在提供签名校验和，用户可在运行安装包前验证文件完整性 (#1019)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Windows 后台服务崩溃导致同步或传输中断的问题 (#1006)\n- 发布说明区域的滚动条现在更轻量，并与应用其他位置保持一致 (#1027)",
